## Layout

```
{{ experiment_name }}/
  register.py        # registers this recipe with the core
  episodes.py        # build_episodes — {{ anchoring_strategy }} anchoring
  eval.py            # evaluate — model -> metrics
  summarize.py       # {{ summarizer_class }} — runs -> leaderboard CSV
  configs/           # data/ models/ sweeps/ (experiment-owned)
  results/           # run output (gitignored; README only)
  trained_models/    # checkpoints (gitignored; README only)
  scripts/ docs/     # experiment-specific tooling and notes
```

## Getting started

1. Implement the three `NotImplementedError` stubs: `build_episodes`
   (`episodes.py`), `evaluate` (`eval.py`), and `_parse_run_dir` (`summarize.py`).
2. Add data/model configs under `configs/`.
3. Run the forecasting workflow with `--experiment {{ experiment_name }}`; run
   outputs resolve under this experiment's `results/` and `trained_models/`.

